### Get Reviews for Store
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews?target_type=store&target_id={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerAuthToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

> {%
  client.test("Store reviews returned", function() {
